Aerie-Purpose: Build the Aerie Guard panel's Lit page (chrome/browser/resources/aerie_guard) into the browser's resources: list its target, pack its pak, give its grd an id range and let it use the Lit build.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/resources/BUILD.gn, chrome/chrome_paks.gni, tools/gritsettings/resource_ids.spec, third_party/lit/v3_0/BUILD.gn
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #100. The grd of the page gets the ids 10280 to 10299, after the 10270 range of
patches/adblock/0009 (Aerie reserves ids from 10270). third_party/lit/v3_0 limits who may depend on
its build_ts target, so the page's build_ts is added to that list.

--- a/chrome/browser/resources/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/resources/BUILD.gn
@@ -63,2 +63,3 @@
       "actor_overlay:resources",
+      "aerie_guard:resources",
       "app_service_internals:resources",
--- a/chrome/chrome_paks.gni
+++ b/chrome/chrome_paks.gni
@@ -226,2 +226,3 @@
         "$root_gen_dir/chrome/access_code_cast_resources.pak",
+        "$root_gen_dir/chrome/aerie_guard_resources.pak",
         "$root_gen_dir/chrome/app_service_internals_resources.pak",
--- a/tools/gritsettings/resource_ids.spec
+++ b/tools/gritsettings/resource_ids.spec
@@ -1807,2 +1807,7 @@
 
+  "<(SHARED_INTERMEDIATE_DIR)/chrome/browser/resources/aerie_guard/resources.grd": {
+    "META": {"sizes": {"includes": [20]}},
+    "includes": [10280],
+  },
+
   "<(SHARED_INTERMEDIATE_DIR)/THIS_IS_A_PLACEHOLDER.grd": {
--- a/third_party/lit/v3_0/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/lit/v3_0/BUILD.gn
@@ -29,2 +29,3 @@
     "//chrome/browser/resources/actor_overlay:build_ts",
+    "//chrome/browser/resources/aerie_guard:build_ts",
     "//chrome/browser/resources/app_home:build_ts",
